ed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gVVGGXCdkZEZzmIbJj9hOL1HG0F.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41363636363636364,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":31611,\"title\":\"Powder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s0qJ3MErKBUJtX0uIIKP2bE4rkT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4095744680851064,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":2409,\"title\":\"Sleeper Cell\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwV1zZSvijp2vfrizmBNCHxMeEI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2868913857677903,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31631,\"title\":\"Covert Affairs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pRWUGSGdByQHW93DH2braqkRjZa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28593272171253825,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":62620,\"title\":\"No Offence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yqftJK3cwbbjmfm8SsN2kjBezVc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2815426997245179,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":214032,\"title\":\"Citadel: Diana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pXfgTz0uYUfYVEiJ0gRra6tKoAp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2810897435897436,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":2319,\"title\":\"The Beat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pS49rEj0XIKxKLDEHelW0YH63vZ.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2788617886178862,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":62927,\"title\":\"Wicked City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myEcHo82olJ5HM5IC9hTCehSpIV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2739837398373984,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":214005,\"title\":\"The Lost\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4xRGSC3zJgwPDwGI5UEJndgCleX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27389558232931727,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"An ordinary boy from a suburb of Sofia became the first undercover police officer in Bulgaria. Forced as a child by his father to steal and cheat, Martin becomes the perfect liar. This skill of his, as well as his hatred for the underworld, make him the most suitable person for a dangerous mission - to be implemented in the criminal organization of a large and influential businessman. While delving into the group's secrets and living in constant fear of being discovered, Martin falls in love with the most inappropriate of women - Djaro's friend Sunny. Just as he gains the trust of the mobsters, it turns out that the real enemies are in the police. Martin is left alone against everyone, facing difficult decisions.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yXhHoDnltCqWuVlqStXwahixcEZ.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2011-04-17\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Young policeman Martin Hristov prepares for his first mission and changes his identity.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/KWX7i9w9JocK1dg12CRpP4Kcwk.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"When a big shipment of drugs is hijacked, Martin gets the chance to gain Petar’s trust. If he’s successful he’ll get to meet Tundzakov in person.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/huCTFqSsfOYRIFJArE547Xs2LLg.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Martin gathers information about the next drug deal. A traitor in the police department puts Martin’s life and mission in danger.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cyQi8QEytaDEJAmR8ioLgip2BXi.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-01\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Dzharo suspects that there’s a traitor in the gang. An unfortunate turn of events puts Zdravko’s loyalty under question.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o2nG9QKDblNjOgIG02KuNift2rL.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-08\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"One of Dzharo’s men tries to reveal the identity of the undercover agent sent to the gang. The mafia boss orders Martin to punish a disloyal dealer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AeAKeRkA2yk05afrZ60oQ9n6NpC.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Dzharo organizes a robbery lead by Martin. Sunny and Martin meet at the studio and passion sparks between them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kn5qBEq0DeoaUezyJYygjrQbzuH.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-22\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"When Dzharo assigns to Martin the task of blackmailing parliament member Ana Nedelcheva with the next video, an unfortunate chain of events unfold.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9WdIOJcUidAVnOVHn4RKblzf7Sa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-29\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"After ordering the killing of a well-known drug boss, Dzharo organizes a meeting with the bosses at a full contact match to clarify the situation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wos3cpwKKy3s8vn0MSdy8dV3fP3.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Martin informs Dzharo that someone is planning to assassinate him. Sunny discovers that Martin is an undercover agent.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hbs8bbZsuYZZal4mLUkwgLPewWy.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Sunny and Martin make a deal to help each other. Popov receives a promotion and his old post is taken by Vasil Nikolav – Dzharo’s informer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aUsHzIo4ZY3JvyHNS8lmjHWc0P6.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Sunny has disappeared and no one knows where she is. Martin is following Ivo, and sees him with Nikolov.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/15u3mcfg5jF9pJA2jsAilFnTsw3.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Popov arrests Dzharo but he is later released due to a lack of evidence. Martin takes a bullet trying to save Popov.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4gwo8pZCvX9Hy3KDLijh6vNYyZj.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-03\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2011-04-17\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}